DEFINE POPUP shortcut SHORTCUT RELATIVE FROM MROW(),MCOL()
DEFINE BAR 1 OF shortcut PROMPT "Class 1"
DEFINE BAR 2 OF shortcut PROMPT "Class 2"
ON SELECTION BAR 1 OF shortcut mproc = 1
ON SELECTION BAR 2 OF shortcut mproc = 2

ACTIVATE POPUP shortcut